OL,3,GNEWSARoyal visit shines spotlight on
OL,4,Arescue charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Princess Royal met search and
OL,7,Frescue volunteers in Shropshire,
OL,8,Fincluding a woman who became involved
OL,9,Fwith the charity after the death of her
OL,10,Fhusband.
OL,12,FDuring a visit to the West Mid
OL,13,FShowground in Shrewsbury on Thursday,
OL,14,FPrincess Anne met representatives from
OL,15,FWest Mercia Search and Rescue and
OL,16,FShrewsbury Men's Shed.
OL,18,FAmong them was charity ambassador
OL,19,FKirsty Walsh, who has supported West
OL,20,FMercia Search and Rescue since her
OL,21,Fhusband, Shane Walsh, died after
OL,22,Ffalling into the River Severn in 2017.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
